<title>USA: Illinois direct hogs $1.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Illinois direct hogs $1.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SPRINGFIELD 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 lower.  Demand very light on light offerings. Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US 1-2  230-260 lbs.  58.00-59.00</p>
<p>US 2-3  230-260 lbs.  57.00-58.00</p>
<p>Sows: Steady in a limited test. Top 49.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3  300-400 lbs. 42.00-44.00, few 45.00</p>
<p>	  400-500 lbs. 44.00-46.00</p>
<p>	  500-600 lbs. 46.00-48.00, few 49.00</p>
